{t:'Match the General Term',g:'Connect the sequence to its formula.',i:'Here a₁ = 100 mg is the amount at time zero, and each step of n is one 6-hour interval. Match each term to its value, then find a₅.',h:'For a₅, substitute n = 5, so the exponent is 4.',
